description: Navigation (AppNavHost/AppDestinations) conventions
globs: app/src/main/java/com/kira/android_base/app/presentation/navigation/**/*.kt
alwaysApply: false
---

# Navigation
- Update `AppDestinations` for new routes (use simple string constants).
- Register destinations only inside `AppNavHost` using `composable(AppDestinations.X)`.
- Prefer explicit `popUpTo(...){ inclusive = true }` when replacing auth flow screens.
- Route-to-ViewModel wiring is done via Hilt (`hiltViewModel()` / `@HiltViewModel`).

